        "text": "The petitioner argues that Congress allows certain aliens of good moral character to be eligible for voluntary departure and permits a single motion to reopen within 90 days of a final order."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0feedba992cc4206108d209d55fcfc845a2e9ea7385e6c3720aaf24aa248cec6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0feedba992cc-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether, by regulation, an alien who is outside the United States can pursue a motion to reopen."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0feedba992cc4206108d209d55fcfc845a2e9ea7385e6c3720aaf24aa248cec6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0feedba992cc-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 27
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, justice Souter questioned whether Congress intended only a modest right to reopen, given that many motions may be filed after the voluntary\u2011departure deadline."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice BREYER",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0feedba992cc4206108d209d55fcfc845a2e9ea7385e6c3720aaf24aa248cec6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0feedba992cc-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked whether the automatic tolling rule would continue if a motion to reopen is denied."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice GINSBURG",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0feedba992cc4206108d209d55fcfc845a2e9ea7385e6c3720aaf24aa248cec6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0feedba992cc-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 43,
              "start": 43
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked why the solution is not to withdraw or relinquish voluntary departure."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice SOUTER",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0feedba992cc4206108d209d55fcfc845a2e9ea7385e6c3720aaf24aa248cec6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0feedba992cc-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter also asked whether an alien could unilaterally relinquish voluntary\u2011departure status without Board approval."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice ALITO",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0feedba992cc4206108d209d55fcfc845a2e9ea7385e6c3720aaf24aa248cec6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-0feedba992cc-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether the statute requires tolling of the departure deadline when a motion to reopen is filed."
      }
